{"id":"n67622-4-6","stage":3,"title":"엮다 · 编","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67622-4-6-1","ko":"우와, 이 앨범은 뭐야?","zh":"哇，这是什么相册？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우와,","meaning":"哇","explanation":"우와：哇","readings":[{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:우와:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"우와","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"앨범은","meaning":"相册，影集，照相簿","explanation":"앨범：相册，影集，照相簿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"앨범","audio":"/audio/6f34dac7c92b91a25a59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14284","senseId":"1","lemma":"앨범","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앨범은","audio":"/audio/d597c9ff07b9e23d21fd.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d727fbbe4b971d2","term":"우와","zh":"哇","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3","definition":"惊讶、赞叹时的感叹。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6f34dac7c92b91a2","term":"앨범","zh":"相册，影集，照相簿","audio":"/audio/6f34dac7c92b91a25a59.mp3","entryId":"14284","definition":"为黏贴或插入并保存相片而制成的书。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/829febcbbd7a6dd699dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67622-4-6-2","ko":"내가 어릴 때 찍은 사진을 엮어서 만든 거야.","zh":"把我小时候拍的照片整理在一起做成的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"어릴","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어릴","audio":"/audio/71ea3b356b8cce922ee9.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"찍은","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찍은","audio":"/audio/4a002e41a75fe18b2d06.mp3"}},{"text":"사진을","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진을","audio":"/audio/3394e235d3ed53a58eaf.mp3"}},{"text":"엮어서","meaning":"编，编集","explanation":"엮다：编，编集；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"엮다","audio":"/audio/fc3c04f5441284ab285a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67622","senseId":"4","lemma":"엮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엮어서","audio":"/audio/de546854d10de19d2040.mp3"}},{"text":"만든","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만든","audio":"/audio/ff3d22622fd1cccc3625.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"fc3c04f5441284ab","term":"엮다","zh":"编，编集","audio":"/audio/fc3c04f5441284ab285a.mp3","entryId":"67622","definition":"收集资料而编纂成书。","pronunciation":["역따"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用